OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA murky start for many,
OL,6,Fespecially in the west as areas of
OL,7,Fmist and fog gradually lift. Bright or
OL,8,Fsunny spells will slowly develop,
OL,9,Fthough isolated coastal showers remain
OL,10,Fpossible. Light winds and near-average
OL,11,Ftemperatures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FVariable amount of cloud
OL,14,Fthough most parts will remain dry.
OL,15,FLong clear spells inland are likely
OL,16,Fafter midnight, though a frost and
OL,17,Fareas of fog are expected to develop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
