OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAreas of fog will be slow to
OL,6,Fclear in many places on Monday,
OL,7,Felsewhere some bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fmay develop. Light winds and average
OL,9,Ftemperatures where the fog clears.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fbut dry after early fog Tuesday,
OL,13,Fslowly giving way to breezier
OL,14,Fconditions and rain from the
OL,15,Fsouthwest. Wednesday unsettled before
OL,16,Fturning drier and brighter from the
OL,17,Fnorth on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
